<title>UK: WestLB sets two bonds total 1.0 bln marks.</title>
<headline>WestLB sets two bonds total 1.0 bln marks.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bonds were announced by lead manager Westdeutsche Landesbank GZ.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY    16.FEB.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  85.40     PAY DATE    11.FEB.97</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    LISTING    DUES	DENOMS (K)  100</p>
<p>* * * *</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON   **2.25	MATURITY    07.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.80     PAY DATE    11.FEB.97</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 100	 LISTING    DUES	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	**FOR YEAR ONE, 3.25 IN YEAR TWO, 4.25 IN YEAR THREE</p>
<p>		5.25 IN YEAR FOUR AND 6.25 TO MATURITY</p>
<p>--REUTER LONDON NEWSROOM +44 171 542 7658</p>
